        ask: 'What do you say?',
        model: 'I’d start with something true and specific that went well, then the challenge, with the care said out loud: “You asked for honest, so here it is, because I want the operators to own this. You spoke for about 40 of the 60 minutes, and after the first round the operators said very little. Next time, shall we agree you ask the first question and then hold back for ten minutes?”',
