        kind: 'faded',
        text: 'Week 6 at a food plant. Team leader Rik has a storyboard for cutting start-up scrap. His experiment record: week 4, “new start-up checklist”; week 5, “retrain operators on the checklist”. Expected result, both times: “better”. Obstacle parking lot: “communication”, “motivation”. He has had six coaching cycles with his manager, whom you second-coach.',
        ask: 'What would you do next?',
